{"name":"Shot in the Dark","hex":"#1d0d1d","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"shot in the dark","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A guess or attempt made with little or no information, evidence, or expectation of success."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shot_in_the_dark"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shot in the Dark (AC/DC song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Shot in the Dark\" is a single by Australian rock band AC/DC from their seventeenth studio album Power Up. The song was recorded late 2018 to early 2019. It was released on 7 October 2020, and is the band's first single released since 2015's \"Rock the Blues Away\" from their album Rock or Bust. The song was used as the official theme for WWE Survivor Series and is part of the MLB The Show 21 soundtrack."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f8/ACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shot_in_the_Dark_(AC%2FDC_song)","wikidata":"Q100141824"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f8/ACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg/250px-ACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f8/ACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f8/ACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg/250px-ACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AACDC_-_Shot_in_the_Dark.jpg"}],"sounds":{"shot in the dark":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/En-au-shot_in_the_dark.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipe